{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 2,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 318.767,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.715,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, it came to pass that the Lord spake unto my father,",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.895,
      "end": 6.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even in a dream, and said unto him:",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.583,
      "end": 11.366,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Blessed art thou Lehi, because of the things which thou hast done;",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.546,
      "end": 13.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because thou hast been faithful",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.769,
      "end": 17.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and declared unto this people the things which I commanded thee,",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.618,
      "end": 20.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, they seek to take away thy life.",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.806,
      "end": 27.075,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lord commanded my father, even in a dream, that he should take his family",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 27.255,
      "end": 30.041,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and depart into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 30.721,
      "end": 34.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he was obedient unto the word of the Lord,",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 35.173,
      "end": 37.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore he did as the Lord commanded him.",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 38.593,
      "end": 41.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he departed into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 42.024,
      "end": 45.182,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he left his house, and the land of his inheritance,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 45.362,
      "end": 47.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his gold, and his silver,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 47.539,
      "end": 50.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his precious things, and took nothing with him,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 50.784,
      "end": 52.549,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were his family,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 52.729,
      "end": 55.005,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and provisions, and tents,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 55.185,
      "end": 57.6,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and departed into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 58.28,
      "end": 62.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he came down by the borders near the shore of the Red Sea;",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 62.361,
      "end": 64.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he traveled in the wilderness",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 64.538,
      "end": 67.371,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the borders which are nearer the Red Sea;",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 67.551,
      "end": 73.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did travel in the wilderness with his family, which consisted of my mother, Sariah,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 73.629,
      "end": 77.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my elder brothers, who were Laman, Lemuel, and Sam.",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 78.303,
      "end": 82.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when he had traveled three days in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 82.988,
      "end": 86.982,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he pitched his tent in a valley by the side of a river of water.",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 87.662,
      "end": 91.47,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he built an altar of stones,",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 91.65,
      "end": 93.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and made an offering unto the Lord,",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 94.059,
      "end": 96.427,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and gave thanks unto the Lord our God.",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 97.107,
      "end": 101.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he called the name of the river, Laman,",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 101.188,
      "end": 103.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it emptied into the Red Sea;",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 103.783,
      "end": 107.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the valley was in the borders near the mouth thereof.",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 107.9,
      "end": 113.38,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when my father saw that the waters of the river emptied into the fountain of the Red Sea,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 113.56,
      "end": 115.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he spake unto Laman, saying:",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 115.644,
      "end": 118.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O that thou mightest be like unto this river,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 118.796,
      "end": 122.14,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "continually running into the fountain of all righteousness!",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 122.82,
      "end": 125.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also spake unto Lemuel:",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 125.276,
      "end": 128.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O that thou mightest be like unto this valley,",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 128.335,
      "end": 133.304,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "firm and steadfast, and immovable in keeping the commandments of the Lord!",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 133.984,
      "end": 139.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this he spake because of the stiffneckedness of Laman and Lemuel;",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 139.319,
      "end": 143.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold they did murmur in many things against their father,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 143.679,
      "end": 145.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because he was a visionary man,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 145.809,
      "end": 148.828,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had led them out of the land of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 149.008,
      "end": 151.469,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to leave the land of their inheritance,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 151.649,
      "end": 155.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their gold, and their silver, and their precious things,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 155.637,
      "end": 157.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to perish in the wilderness.",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 157.535,
      "end": 161.854,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this they said he had done because of the foolish imaginations of his heart.",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 162.534,
      "end": 165.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus Laman and Lemuel, being the eldest,",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 165.686,
      "end": 168.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did murmur against their father.",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 168.188,
      "end": 170.789,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did murmur because they knew not",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 170.969,
      "end": 173.941,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the dealings of that God who had created them.",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 174.621,
      "end": 181.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Neither did they believe that Jerusalem, that great city, could be destroyed according to the words of the prophets.",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 181.535,
      "end": 188.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were like unto the Jews who were at Jerusalem, who sought to take away the life of my father.",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 188.856,
      "end": 196.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that my father did speak unto them in the valley of Lemuel, with power, being filled with the Spirit,",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 196.791,
      "end": 199.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until their frames did shake before him.",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 199.618,
      "end": 201.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he did confound them,",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 201.423,
      "end": 203.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they durst not utter against him;",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 204.018,
      "end": 206.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they did as he commanded them.",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 207.159,
      "end": 208.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And my father dwelt in a tent.",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 209.65,
      "end": 213.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I, Nephi, being exceedingly young,",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 213.406,
      "end": 215.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless being large in stature,",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 215.954,
      "end": 219.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also having great desires to know of the mysteries of God,",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 220.128,
      "end": 222.496,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I did cry unto the Lord;",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 222.676,
      "end": 224.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold he did visit me,",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 224.714,
      "end": 230.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did soften my heart that I did believe all the words which had been spoken by my father;",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 230.374,
      "end": 233.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I did not rebel against him like unto my brothers.",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 234.258,
      "end": 235.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I spake unto Sam,",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 236.063,
      "end": 238.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "making known unto him the things",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 238.658,
      "end": 241.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which the Lord had manifested unto me by his Holy Spirit.",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 242.135,
      "end": 245.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he believed in my words.",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 245.973,
      "end": 250.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, behold, Laman and Lemuel would not hearken unto my words;",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 250.843,
      "end": 254.372,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and being grieved because of the hardness of their hearts",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 254.552,
      "end": 256.549,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I cried unto the Lord for them.",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 257.229,
      "end": 260.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lord spake unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 260.52,
      "end": 263.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Blessed art thou, Nephi, because of thy faith,",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 263.719,
      "end": 267.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou hast sought me diligently, with lowliness of heart.",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 268.207,
      "end": 271.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And inasmuch as ye shall keep my commandments,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 271.406,
      "end": 272.939,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall prosper,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 273.119,
      "end": 279.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall be led to a land of promise; yea, even a land which I have prepared for you; yea,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 279.476,
      "end": 282.495,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a land which is choice above all other lands.",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 283.175,
      "end": 286.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And inasmuch as thy brethren shall rebel against thee,",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 286.42,
      "end": 289.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be cut off from the presence of the Lord.",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 290.258,
      "end": 293.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And inasmuch as thou shalt keep my commandments,",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 293.364,
      "end": 297.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou shalt be made a ruler and a teacher over thy brethren.",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 297.713,
      "end": 300.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, in that day that they shall rebel against me,",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 301.144,
      "end": 303.512,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will curse them even with a sore curse,",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 303.692,
      "end": 306.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall have no power over thy seed",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 306.705,
      "end": 309.399,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except they shall rebel against me also.",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 310.079,
      "end": 312.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if it so be that they rebel against me,",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 313.092,
      "end": 315.414,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be a scourge unto thy seed,",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 315.594,
      "end": 318.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to stir them up in the ways of remembrance.",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 93
    }
  ]
}